<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective April 9.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.42     23.42	  4.59-9.82  4.59-9.82</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.42     23.42	  4.40-9.39  4.40-9.39</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.32     25.78	 12.07	12.36</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.32     25.78	  7.55	 7.82</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.26	  0.39	 0.39</p>
</text>
